What:		/sys/bus/wmi/devices/0B30FD67-1B62-4FCA-B10B-50DC7ADE6A39-*/performance_mode
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.2
Contact:	linux-acpi@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		(RO) Raw firmware performance mode integer reported by GPFM
		(0x03/0x09): 1 (balanced) or 2 (performance). Note: runtime
		selection uses the standard platform_profile class interface
		when allow_writes=1; this raw attribute may move to debugfs
		before upstream submission.

What:		/sys/bus/wmi/devices/0B30FD67-1B62-4FCA-B10B-50DC7ADE6A39-*/fn_lock
What:		/sys/bus/wmi/devices/0B30FD67-1B62-4FCA-B10B-50DC7ADE6A39-*/win_lock
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	7.2
Contact:	linux-acpi@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		(RO/RW) Current Fn-lock or Windows-key-lock state ("0" or "1")
		queried via GFLS (0x03/0x03) / GWLS (0x03/0x01). Default mode is
		0444; becomes 0644 when loaded with allow_lock_writes=1, writing
		via SFLS (0x03/0x04) / SWLS (0x03/0x02) followed by settling
		delay and readback verification.

What:		/sys/bus/wmi/devices/0B30FD67-1B62-4FCA-B10B-50DC7ADE6A39-*/touchpad_enabled
